    {
      "id": "486cd3700a1a",
      "source": "FBX, OBJ, ABC Import",
      "target": "FBX、OBJ、ABC 导入",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "e315519dcc90",
      "source": "LiquiGen can import models and animations from other 3d packages to be used as emitters, colliders, or as holdout objects for your renders.",
      "target": "LiquiGen 可以从其他 3D 软件包导入模型和动画，用作渲染中的发射器、碰撞体或遮挡对象。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cdb1f29f2bc8",
      "source": "This can be done using the ",
      "target": "这可以通过 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "06f5f6e55c0c",
      "source": "Import",
      "target": "Import",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b66d94b42372",
      "source": " node.",
      "target": " 节点完成。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e13c12e5bb25",
      "source": "You can browse for your file from the ",
      "target": "可以在 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d7af114a0cb4",
      "source": "Asset",
      "target": "Asset",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4cadc0384b15",
      "source": " tab.",
      "target": " 选项卡中浏览并选择文件。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e70eba46c5ff",
      "source": "We primarily support the FBX file format but you can also use OBJ or ABC files.",
      "target": "我们主要支持 FBX 文件格式，但也可以使用 OBJ 或 ABC 文件。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bacc5798288d",
      "source": "For Alembic, only the OGAWA format is supported!",
      "target": "对于 Alembic，仅支持 OGAWA 格式！",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "37d88d8e09a9",
      "source": "Note that imported models should be suitable for simulation. This means the geometry should be closed. Also, for any part thinner than the voxel size the geometry can’t be processed properly for simulation.",
      "target": "请注意，导入的模型应适合模拟。这意味着几何体应当闭合。另外，任何薄于体素尺寸的部分，其几何体都无法被正确处理以用于模拟。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "56712f919b53",
      "source": "You will want to store these files locally. Loading your imported mesh from a network drive can cause instability in simulations and renders.",
      "target": "建议将这些文件存放在本地。从网络驱动器加载导入的网格可能会导致模拟和渲染不稳定。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "efa87c2af27d",
      "source": "The ",
      "target": "该 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "71a39022efd1",
      "source": "Geometry",
      "target": "Geometry",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7b0790965d97",
      "source": " output pin can be connected to any ",
      "target": " 输出引脚可以连接到任意 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2ffb604b7db2",
      "source": "Shapes",
      "target": "Shapes",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7325a613d4af",
      "source": " or ",
      "target": " 或 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a8c6a49481b6",
      "source": "Mask Shapes",
      "target": "Mask Shapes",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4ccc9917cc72",
      "source": " input pin.",
      "target": " 输入引脚。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "651a09576149",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "bfed27cce811",
      "source": "You can separate models or even parts of models out using the ",
      "target": "可以使用 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "de7d48f3b595",
      "source": "Mask",
      "target": "Mask",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "70793338ab53",
      "source": " outputs.",
      "target": " 输出分离模型，甚至分离模型的一部分。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "302dcbeb18a8",
      "source": "These masks each have their own tab where you can specify what you need to be masked by picking a mesh from the list or a specific set of bones.",
      "target": "这些遮罩各自都有自己的选项卡，你可以在其中从列表选择网格或指定骨骼集，来指定需要被遮罩的内容。",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6b07d48e8ab9",
      "source": "The ",
      "target": "这些 ",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7dc4e9f24a20",
      "source": "Mask",
      "target": "Mask",
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6b50042b621c",
      "source": " output pins will only output the shapes specified in that mask.",
      "target": " 输出引脚只会输出该遮罩中指定的形状。",
      "note": ""
    },
